NOTE ON SCOPE

This licence covers the original source code of this project only - the server,
the game engine, the renderer, the session and leaderboard logic, the styling
and the tooling.

It does NOT cover the media files under `public/assets/` (character
photographs and audio clips). Those were gathered for a one-off university
tech-fest stall and remain the property of their respective rights holders.
They are not licensed for reuse or redistribution. See ASSETS.md.
